  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note at part heading for Lab 502) #5235, eff 9-27-91, EXPIRED: 9-27-97 New. #6631, INTERIM, eff 11-16-97, EXPIRED: 3-16-98 New. #6806, eff 7-18-98 (formerly Lab 502.07); ss by #8682, INTERIM, eff 7-15-06, EXPIRED: 1-11-07 New. #9019, eff 11-1-07; ss by #11067, eff 4-1-16 (from Lab 502.07)",
